    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #333\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPushed to the same branch: `bb/relay-127-mcp-integration-06-07-manage-project-m-thr_dggg25qrdi`.\n\nThis push adds commit `df1430c`, which addresses the 4 medium-severity findings from the code-review CI check on PR #333:\n\n1. `setProjectMcpGrant` now maps an unknown `mcpToolRegistrationId`'s foreign-key violation to a `NotFoundError` (404) instead of letting a raw Postgres error surface as a 500.\n2. `readJsonBody` in `mcpAgentPageHandler.ts` now catches malformed JSON and raises a `ValidationError` (400) instead of a 500.\n3. `ToolsBlock`'s `useMcpToolGrants` now guards against out-of-order network responses with a load-generation counter, fixing the concurrent-refresh race.\n4. Corrected `ToolsBlock`'s JSDoc, which incorrectly claimed optimistic updates.\n\nAll fixes are covered by new/updated tests. Full verification in this run: backend build (all packages), dependency-boundary check, backend unit (83), integration (594), and e2e (5) tests, plus web build and test suite (94) — all passing.\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
