    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #333\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPushed successfully to branch `bb/relay-127-mcp-integration-06-07-manage-project-m-thr_dggg25qrdi` (`df1430c..26f0d64`).\n\nThis push addresses the latest code-review round on PR #333:\n- **AC #1 (was ❌ Unmet — \"ToolsBlock.tsx is created but never imported or rendered in any AGENT page component\")**: added `web/src/views/agentPage/AgentPage.tsx`, a project AGENT page that renders a Guidance section (from the project item's `agents` property), a Heartbeats placeholder (a real list-by-project heartbeats read needs a module registry that `semprec-api` doesn't currently have access to — confirmed via grep — so that's out of scope here), and mounts `ToolsBlock` below both. Wired in via a new `?page=agent&project=<id>&database=<id>` composition-root route in `main.tsx`/`App.tsx`, mirroring the existing `?page=ai-usage` pattern. Covered by 7 new tests in `AgentPage.test.tsx`.\n- **Remaining open medium finding** (missing test coverage for `reclassifyMcpTool`): added riskClass-select, requiresApproval-checkbox, and per-row-error tests to `ToolsBlock.test.tsx`.\n\nAll checks passed this turn: web typecheck/tests/build, backend `check:boundaries`/build, and the full backend test suite (unit 83/83, integration 593-594/594 with one confirmed-flaky, unrelated Postgres-deadlock test that passes in isolation, e2e 5/5).\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
