    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #333\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPushed successfully to branch `bb/relay-127-mcp-integration-06-07-manage-project-m-thr_dggg25qrdi` (`26f0d64..534a313`).\n\nThis push addresses the latest code-review round on PR #333, which reported all 17 acceptance criteria met but blocked on 1 medium finding plus 2 low-priority notes:\n\n- **Medium finding**: `mcpAgentPageHandler.ts`'s `readJsonBody` buffered the entire request body into memory with no size cap, letting an authenticated caller exhaust server memory with an oversized payload. Now it enforces a 1 MiB limit while streaming and returns `413` once exceeded, with a new integration test covering it.\n- **Low-priority note**: the post-mutation `refresh()` call in `ToolsBlock.tsx` now uses `void refresh()`, matching the initial load's floating-promise handling.\n- **Low-priority note**: the `AgentPage.test.tsx` test titled \"retries on demand\" now actually clicks the retry button and asserts the retried `getItem` call succeeds, instead of only checking the initial error state.\n\nAll checks passed this turn: web typecheck/tests(104/104)/build, backend build/`check:boundaries`/unit(83/83)/integration(594-595/595, one confirmed pre-existing flaky test unrelated to this diff, passes 10/10 in isolation)/e2e(5/5).\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
