    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #333\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nThere were no remaining changes to commit — the working tree was already clean, and the branch `bb/relay-127-mcp-integration-06-07-manage-project-m-thr_dggg25qrdi` was already pushed and up to date on `origin` at commit `74649cf`.\n\nSummary of this run's work (issue #127, \"Manage project MCP grants in the AGENT page\"):\n- Added a real `AgentPage.tsx` mounting the Tools block (checkbox list bound to per-project MCP grants, defaulting to false, grouped by server, with approval/risk metadata and reclassification controls) below Guidance and Heartbeats sections, wired into routing via `?page=agent`.\n- Closed CI-flagged gaps: test coverage for `reclassifyMcpTool`, an unbounded-request-body DoS risk (added a 1 MiB cap returning 413), and two low-priority findings (floating-promise consistency, a retry test that didn't actually exercise retry).\n- Merged `develop` to resolve a conflict against the newly-merged repo-wide ESLint/Prettier introduction, resolving 2 conflicting files in favor of this branch's logic, then reformatted this branch's own files to match the new style.\n- Verified the full suite post-merge: web lint/typecheck/tests (104/104)/build, and backend lint/build/`check:boundaries`/unit (83/83)/integration (595/595)/e2e (5/5) — all green.\n\nBranch: `bb/relay-127-mcp-integration-06-07-manage-project-m-thr_dggg25qrdi` (pushed, up to date at `74649cf`).\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
